  "headline": "FDA's records trace our cephalexin supply to a plant last inspected 2024-09-06 and classified VAI",
  "headline_cites": ["E5", "E4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "All three Corvale sites source cephalexin from Advanced Rx Pharmacy of Tennessee, LLC (FEI 3017450153) under NDC 80425012101.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of that plant ended 2024-09-06 and was classified VAI, with the classification known to FDA on 2024-11-13.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No FDA shortage posting, recall, or OAI classification for this product or plant appears in the provided records.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 5 days on hand (88 units at 17.5/day) and Corvale General has 27 days on hand (399 units at 15.1/day).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 6 days on hand (27 units at 4.4/day) and is not positioned to supply a transfer.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The indicated move is to transfer 157 units from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave General with roughly two weeks of supply and bring East to approximately 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Verify current on-hand and daily-use figures at both sites before executing the transfer, and confirm no new FDA actions have been posted since the last inspection date.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "E4"]
    }
  ]
}
